{"id": 34, "ts": 1780450927.6507475, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s thorough articulation of Candidate\u202fC\u2019s reliability and decision\u2011making strengths, but I remain concerned that the noted communication difficulties and egocentric perception could jeopardize crew coordination on long\u2011haul flights, where sustained interpersonal interaction is critical. In contrast, my own notes on Candidate\u202fB highlight a very conscientious work ethic, strong stress resilience, and excellent weather\u2011assessment and computer skills\u2014directly supporting operational reliability, stress\u2011resilience, and technical competence. While B does have a reputation for making nasty remarks, that issue seems less severe than a persistent communication barrier that could affect safety briefings and in\u2011flight coordination. Given that B\u2019s strengths cover three of the most safety\u2011critical criteria (reliability, stress resilience, technical competence) and the communication concern appears manageable with training, I maintain my provisional vote for Candidate\u202fB as the best overall fit."}
