{"id": 38, "ts": 1780450957.307559, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s enthusiasm for Candidate\u202fB, especially his strong stress handling and conscientiousness. However, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the stronger overall fit for our long\u2011distance pilot role. C\u2019s 100\u202f% reliability and the fact that he consistently creates a positive atmosphere with his crew directly address our top priorities of operational reliability and crew cooperation\u2014both essential for the sustained, high\u2011risk environment of international flights. Moreover, his ability to make correct decisions quickly is a decisive advantage for handling the complex, time\u2011critical situations that arise on long routes. While C does have noted communication challenges and a less proactive stance toward further education, these concerns are outweighed by his proven reliability and decision\u2011making speed, and they can be mitigated through targeted training. In contrast, B\u2019s strengths are offset by his reported uncooperativeness and grumpiness, which could undermine cockpit harmony on extended missions. Therefore, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fC."}
